So the given polynomial factors completely as
\[z^4 + 4z^3i - 6z^2 - 4zi - i = (z - i)(z + i)(z^2 - iz - 1) = (z^2 - 1)(z^2 - iz - 1).\]
The roots of the quadratic $z^2 - 1 = 0$ are $z = 1$ and $z = -1$, and the roots of the quadratic $z^2 - iz - 1 = 0$ are
